Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf:=20GGML=5FCUDA=5FFA=5FMMA=5FMAX=5FKV=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20FlashAttention=20uses=20the=20MMA=20kernel=20only?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20below=20a=20KV=20length?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
